      "message": "Note to reviewers: I did also try `var_part_split_threshold_shift \u003d 7` for speed 8, to avoid the odd-looking non-monotonic adjustment among speeds 7, 8 and 9.\n\nHowever, while there was a \\~1% BD-rate improvement, the resulting slowdown overhead on subset 1 (\\~10%) wasn\u0027t worth the tradeoff. My hypothesis is that the encoder spends significantly more time during the RD part of hybrid intra pick mode, which disproportionately affects encode time.\n\nSpeed 9 purely uses non-RD intra pick mode, so lowering the split threshold shift doesn\u0027t affect encode time as much.",
